 ('table', 'XI', 'T8', 'BO-Selected SwinFusion++ Compared With the Fixed-Recipe Encoders'),
 ('p', 'Within datasets, the BO-selected configuration had the highest point estimates of any model evaluated on FF++ C40 (0.9941) and Celeb-DF v2 (0.9983), but none of its eight differences from the encoders was significant, so these leads are descriptive. Under transfer, it was significantly better than Swin-B in six of the nine directions and, from FF++ C23 to C40, significantly better than both encoders (+0.0123 and +0.0116). It was significantly worse than Video Swin-B from FF++ C23 to DeeperForensics-1.0 (−0.1105) and from Celeb-DF v2 to FF++ C23 (−0.0390).'),
